# Dropped in the working directory by Intel's graphics compiler when OpenVINO compiles kernels for
# the iGPU (ANALYTICS_DEVICE=GPU). A diagnostic from its own igc_check self-test, not ours, and not
# something that stops inference -- but it lands wherever the worker was started from.
kernel.errors.txt
